# Commit and deploy

After finishing requested work on this site, commit the relevant files and push to `origin` so production deploys. Do not wait for a separate "commit and deploy" request.

- Commit only files related to the requested change (HTML, assets, and supporting files that the change needs).
- Do not stage unrelated untracked images, leftover PDFs, or local deletions.
- Never amend a commit that has already been pushed.
- Deploy by pushing the current branch to `origin` (this repo deploys from `main`).
- After pushing, report the commit and that it was pushed.
